'''Neon''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "N30N.” It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired.

==Appearance==
Its blade is neon green, the guard is light neon pink, and the handle is neon blue, hence the name. 

==Trivia== 
*It was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/465456/profile/ DesDesNeverDie]. However, it was a knife submission for [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2's]] rival game ''Murder'' in 2014.<ref>https://www.roblox.com/library/159653652/laserknife</ref>
*It is the third code knife to be released in [[Murder Mystery 2]], the others being [[Gifted]] and [[Reptile]].
*The code for this knife released on December 30th, 2014, and the code could only be redeemed for 24 hours before officially expiring<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/550073296767971328</ref>.

